{"body":[{"tweet_id":"2125866125015613663","text":"This was one of the craziest Laravel bugs I reported (CVE-2026-114508). A read-only GET request could wipe an entire database table 🚨  \n\nWith Laravel's JSON:API resources, changing ?include=comments to ?include=comments.truncate passed \"truncate\" straight to Eloquent without checking the child resource. Even though the request returned HTTP 500, Laravel had already run TRUNCATE TABLE comments.\n\nPatched in Laravel 12.68.0 & 13.27.0 (PR #61322).  \n\nMore info 👇","username":"kikomanasijev","tweet_url":"https://x.com/kikomanasijev/status/2125866125015613663","first_link":"https://x.com/kikomanasijev/status/2125866125015613663/photo/1","created_at":"November 26, 2026 at 05:15PM","liked_at":"2026-11-26T19:56:04.207137","source":"ifttt","private":false,"notfound":false,"react_tweet_data":{"__typename":"Tweet","favorite_count":664,"lang":"en","possibly_sensitive":false,"created_at":"2026-11-26T08:15:55.000Z","display_text_range":[0,276],"entities":{"media":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/32H3WUeIfx","expanded_url":"https://x.com/kikomanasijev/status/2125866125015613663/photo/1","indices":[276,299],"url":"https://t.co/32H3WUeIfx"}]},"id_str":"2125866125015613663","text":"This was one of the craziest Laravel bugs I reported (CVE-2026-114508). A read-only GET request could wipe an entire database table 🚨  \n\nWith Laravel's JSON:API resources, changing ?include=comments to ?include=comments.truncate passed \"truncate\" straight to Eloquent without https://t.co/32H3WUeIfx","user":{"id_str":"1376444772311777285","name":"Hristijan Manasijev","screen_name":"kikomanasijev","is_blue_verified":true,"profile_image_shape":"Circle","verified":false,"profile_image_url_https":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1376444934711087105/-Rp6bskZ_normal.jpg"},"edit_control":{"edit_tweet_ids":["2125866125015613663"],"editable_until_msecs":"1795684555000","edits_remaining":"5","is_edit_eligible":false},"mediaDetails":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/32H3WUeIfx","expanded_url":"https://x.com/kikomanasijev/status/2125866125015613663/photo/1","ext_media_availability":{"status":"Available"},"indices":[276,299],"media_url_https":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HYCXtmCX0AAXDoJ.jpg","original_info":{"focus_rects":[{"h":1210,"w":2160,"x":0,"y":0},{"h":2160,"w":2160,"x":0,"y":0},{"h":2160,"w":1895,"x":133,"y":0},{"h":2160,"w":1080,"x":540,"y":0},{"h":2160,"w":2160,"x":0,"y":0}],"height":2160,"width":2160},"sizes":{"large":{"h":2048,"resize":"fit","w":2048},"medium":{"h":1200,"resize":"fit","w":1200},"small":{"h":680,"resize":"fit","w":680},"thumb":{"h":150,"resize":"crop","w":150}},"type":"photo","url":"https://t.co/32H3WUeIfx"}],"photos":[{"backgroundColor":{"red":204,"green":214,"blue":221},"cropCandidates":[{"h":1210,"w":2160,"x":0,"y":0},{"h":2160,"w":2160,"x":0,"y":0},{"h":2160,"w":1895,"x":133,"y":0},{"h":2160,"w":1080,"x":540,"y":0},{"h":2160,"w":2160,"x":0,"y":0}],"expandedUrl":"https://x.com/kikomanasijev/status/2125866125015613663/photo/1","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HYCXtmCX0AAXDoJ.jpg","width":2160,"height":2160}],"conversation_count":25,"news_action_type":"conversation","isEdited":false,"isStaleEdit":false,"note_tweet":{"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0UmVzdWx0czoyMTI1ODY2MTI0OTMxNjU3NzI4"}}},{"tweet_id":"2125922590396969068","text":"Je suis sur le cul, jamais rien vu de si beau et terrifiant\n\nhttps://t.co/DcbEJAFhCY","username":"mo_alani_yes","tweet_url":"https://x.com/mo_alani_yes/status/2125922590396969068","first_link":"https://claude.ai/artifact/Cy2d8Vn63CnzCtonA1LSah#dominoes","created_at":"November 26, 2026 at 09:00PM","liked_at":"2026-11-26T19:51:17.436990","source":"ifttt","private":false,"notfound":false,"react_tweet_data":{"__typename":"Tweet","favorite_count":1768,"lang":"fr","possibly_sensitive":false,"created_at":"2026-11-26T12:00:17.000Z","display_text_range":[0,84],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"claude.ai/artifact/Cy2d8…","expanded_url":"https://claude.ai/artifact/Cy2d8Vn63CnzCtonA1LSah#dominoes","indices":[61,84],"url":"https://t.co/DcbEJAFhCY"}]},"id_str":"2125922590396969068","text":"Je suis sur le cul, jamais rien vu de si beau et terrifiant\n\nhttps://t.co/DcbEJAFhCY","user":{"id_str":"1384790824215531522","name":"Mo","screen_name":"mo_alani_yes","is_blue_verified":true,"profile_image_shape":"Circle","verified":false,"profile_image_url_https":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2112925738231824384/ORjTjNvj_normal.jpg"},"edit_control":{"edit_tweet_ids":["2125922590396969068"],"editable_until_msecs":"1795698017000","edits_remaining":"5","is_edit_eligible":false},"conversation_count":51,"news_action_type":"conversation","card":{"card_platform":{"platform":{"audience":{"name":"production"},"device":{"name":"iPhone","version":"13"}}},"name":"summary","url":"https://t.co/DcbEJAFhCY","binding_values":{"thumbnail_image":{"image_value":{"height":144,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2124661486694100992/7j3toWq1?format=png&name=144x144_2","width":144},"type":"IMAGE"},"description":{"string_value":"A talk on the intelligence explosion that opens as a dull default slide, then starts editing itself. Arrow keys to move, A to play by itself, F for full screen.","type":"STRING"},"domain":{"string_value":"claude.ai","type":"STRING"},"thumbnail_image_large":{"image_value":{"height":420,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2124661486694100992/7j3toWq1?format=png&name=420x420_2","width":420},"type":"IMAGE"},"thumbnail_image_original":{"image_value":{"height":640,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2124661486694100992/7j3toWq1?format=png&name=orig","width":1138},"type":"IMAGE"},"thumbnail_image_small":{"image_value":{"height":100,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2124661486694100992/7j3toWq1?format=png&name=100x100_2","width":100},"type":"IMAGE"},"thumbnail_image_x_large":{"image_value":{"height":640,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2124661486694100992/7j3toWq1?format=png&name=2048x2048_2_exp","width":1138},"type":"IMAGE"},"thumbnail_image_alt_text":{"string_value":"Claude Artifact","type":"STRING"},"vanity_url":{"scribe_key":"vanity_url","string_value":"claude.ai","type":"STRING"},"thumbnail_image_color":{"image_color_value":{"palette":[{"percentage":97.96,"rgb":{"blue":240,"green":243,"red":243}},{"percentage":1.26,"rgb":{"blue":122,"green":124,"red":124}},{"percentage":0.73,"rgb":{"blue":60,"green":62,"red":61}},{"percentage":0.42,"rgb":{"blue":113,"green":140,"red":221}}]},"type":"IMAGE_COLOR"},"title":{"string_value":"The Last Boring Slide","type":"STRING"},"card_url":{"scribe_key":"card_url","string_value":"https://t.co/DcbEJAFhCY","type":"STRING"}}},"isEdited":false,"isStaleEdit":false}},{"tweet_id":"2125893367997604151","text":"자고 일어났더니 Agent가 PR 20개를 머지해놨고, 열어보니 다 멀쩡했다고 함. Cursor 엔지니어 Lauren 얘기고, 지난달에는 혼자 PR 1,000개를 머지했음. 비결은 모델도 프롬프트도 아니고 코드베이스.\n\n1. 규칙은 문서 말고 CI로\n프롬프트나 규칙 문서는 Agent가 금방 잊음. useEffect 금지, 주석도 금지, 어기면 CI에서 바로 탕. 리뷰에서 한 줄씩 고치고 있다면 그 자체가 신호고, 고칠 때마다 Lint 규칙으로 바꿀 수 있는지부터 봐야 함.\n\n2. 사람이 테스터 노릇 하지 말 것\n스크린샷 찍고 로그 붙여주기 시작하면 사람이 병목이 됨. Agent가 직접 앱 띄우고 프로파일링하고 재현까지 하게 만듦. Eval 돌릴 땐 모델이 시험인 걸 눈치채면 행동을 바꿔서 디렉터리 이름까지 위장한다고. 이건 좀 무서웠음.\n\n3. 가드레일에 토큰 아끼지 말 것\n초반에 토큰 태워서 가드레일 세워두면 더 작은 모델로도 코드가 잘 나옴. 그 다음엔 PM, 디자이너, 마케터까지 PR을 올리고, CI 통과하면 바로 승인.\n\n\"최단 경로가 최선의 경로.\" Agent는 어차피 지름길로 간다. 막을 생각 말고 지름길을 정답으로 깔아두면 됨.\n\nAI한테 밤새 일 맡길 수 있느냐는 모델 성능보다 코드베이스가 얼마나 튼튼한지에 달려 있다는 얘기. https://t.co/Q4ZSGf1NYo","username":"pinesun11","tweet_url":"https://x.com/pinesun11/status/2125893367997604151","first_link":"https://x.com/0xg4tsby/status/2125532998711886255/video/1","created_at":"November 26, 2026 at 07:04PM","liked_at":"2026-11-26T19:46:17.272271","source":"ifttt","private":false,"notfound":false,"react_tweet_data":{"__typename":"Tweet","favorite_count":256,"lang":"ko","possibly_sensitive":false,"created_at":"2026-11-26T10:04:10.000Z","display_text_range":[0,184],"entities":{"media":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/Q4ZSGf1NYo","expanded_url":"https://x.com/0xg4tsby/status/2125532998711886255/video/1","indices":[648,671],"url":"https://t.co/Q4ZSGf1NYo"}]},"id_str":"2125893367997604151","text":"자고 일어났더니 Agent가 PR 20개를 머지해놨고, 열어보니 다 멀쩡했다고 함. Cursor 엔지니어 Lauren 얘기고, 지난달에는 혼자 PR 1,000개를 머지했음. 비결은 모델도 프롬프트도 아니고 코드베이스.\n\n1. 규칙은 문서 말고 CI로\n프롬프트나 규칙 문서는 Agent가 금방 잊음. useEffect 금지, 주석도","user":{"id_str":"2106734588244676608","name":"푸른소나무","screen_name":"pinesun11","is_blue_verified":true,"profile_image_shape":"Circle","verified":false,"profile_image_url_https":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2113871933993525248/gAmCelbg_normal.jpg"},"edit_control":{"edit_tweet_ids":["2125893367997604151"],"editable_until_msecs":"1795691050000","edits_remaining":"5","is_edit_eligible":true},"mediaDetails":[{"additional_media_info":{},"display_url":"pic.x.com/Q4ZSGf1NYo","expanded_url":"https://x.com/0xg4tsby/status/2125532998711886255/video/1","ext_media_availability":{"status":"Available"},"indices":[648,671],"media_url_https":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2125532357906030592/img/9qFenrg3QngfN-Fh.jpg","original_info":{"focus_rects":[],"height":1080,"width":1926},"sizes":{"large":{"h":1080,"resize":"fit","w":1926},"medium":{"h":673,"resize":"fit","w":1200},"small":{"h":381,"resize":"fit","w":680},"thumb":{"h":150,"resize":"crop","w":150}},"type":"video","url":"https://t.co/Q4ZSGf1NYo","video_info":{"aspect_ratio":[107,60],"duration_millis":3525857,"variants":[{"content_type":"application/x-mpegURL","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2125532357906030592/pl/O0Xtqibhr9akOCra.m3u8?v=37c"},{"bitrate":256000,"content_type":"video/mp4","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2125532357906030592/vid/avc1/480x270/NdQBBAfXxSCiyMEl.mp4"},{"bitrate":832000,"content_type":"video/mp4","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2125532357906030592/vid/avc1/642x360/CdxZzNRT1CJdWudE.mp4"},{"bitrate":2176000,"content_type":"video/mp4","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2125532357906030592/vid/avc1/1284x720/Df4MRqkXJKtOw0Y3.mp4"},{"bitrate":10368000,"content_type":"video/mp4","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2125532357906030592/vid/avc1/1926x1080/4xarDWRm78UYbgq4.mp4"}]}}],"photos":[],"video":{"aspectRatio":[107,60],"contentType":"media_entity","durationMs":3525857,"mediaAvailability":{"status":"available"},"poster":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2125532357906030592/img/9qFenrg3QngfN-Fh.jpg","variants":[{"type":"application/x-mpegURL","src":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2125532357906030592/pl/O0Xtqibhr9akOCra.m3u8?v=37c"},{"type":"video/mp4","src":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2125532357906030592/vid/avc1/480x270/NdQBBAfXxSCiyMEl.mp4"},{"type":"video/mp4","src":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2125532357906030592/vid/avc1/642x360/CdxZzNRT1CJdWudE.mp4"},{"type":"video/mp4","src":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2125532357906030592/vid/avc1/1284x720/Df4MRqkXJKtOw0Y3.mp4"},{"type":"video/mp4","src":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2125532357906030592/vid/avc1/1926x1080/4xarDWRm78UYbgq4.mp4"}],"videoId":{"type":"tweet","id":"2125893367997604151"},"viewCount":0},"conversation_count":6,"news_action_type":"conversation","isEdited":false,"isStaleEdit":false,"note_tweet":{"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0UmVzdWx0czoyMTI1ODkzMzY3ODQyMzg1OTIw"}}},{"tweet_id":"2125565936031973582","text":"刚重听了一遍 Cursor 工程师 Lauren 这场近一小时的实战复盘，越琢磨越觉得反常识：\n\n同样是用 AI 写代码，大多数人还在天天给它擦屁股、被幻觉气到血压飙升，她却能上个月一个人狂合 1,000 个 PR，这个月刚到 12 号又干了近 800 个——甚至做分享那天早上她一觉醒来，Agent 已经在她睡觉时往主分支自动合并了 20 个 PR，她打开扫了一眼，质量全在线。\n\n老程序员听完第一反应肯定是骂街：“吹什么牛，这不就是往生产环境狂灌 AI 垃圾代码（Slop）吗？”\n\n结果曾在 Meta 干过的 Lauren，一句话直接把整个软件行业的遮羞布扯了下来：“在 AI 垃圾代码之前，大厂早就遍地是人类垃圾代码了。” 像 Meta、Google 这种万人工厂，基建从来不是给天才设计的，而是为了防住“团队里最菜的实习生别手滑把生产库删了”。AI 时代最残酷的变化，就是大厂当年的工程噩梦，一夜之间变成了每个团队的日常。\n\n她之所以敢放心睡大觉，秘密根本不是什么“神级 Prompt”，而是反过来干了三件极其反直觉的狠事：\n\n第一，别指望把 AI 训成天才，要把代码库改成“专为蠢货设计的牢笼”。\n\n很多团队做新项目，上来一顿 Vibe Coding，毫无护栏，Agent 怎么省事怎么糊代码，最后代码库彻底失控，谁都看不懂。Lauren 自己就踩过这个坑，后来狠下心花了 600 多个 PR，给新产品 Grockbot 重构出一套代号 Dune 的严苛架构。\n\n她的判断极其冷酷：靠 Prompt、规则文档或代码风格指南管 AI，全都是软约束，Agent 转头就会忘，代码库烂尾只是时间问题。 真正管用的，是把规矩焊死在静态检查和 CI 红灯里：\n\n⚬ 直接禁用 React 的 useEffect，敢写 CI 直接报错打回；\n⚬ 连代码注释都一刀切全禁了！ 听着很离谱，但理由太真实——99% 的时候，AI 写的注释都是把人类在某次 PR 里随口吐槽的一句话当成圣旨永久刻进代码里的历史废话；\n⚬ 把 Electron 的主线程和渲染线程按目录切死，CI 扫描依赖图，敢跨界引用拖垮 16 毫秒/60 帧的流畅度，直接构建失败；一个功能的所有代码全塞进同一个目录，省得它满仓库乱翻。\n\n这套设计背后只有一句核心哲学：“最短路径就是最好路径（The shortest path is the best path）”——既然 Agent 天生爱走捷径、爱抄现有模板，那就把能走通的最短那条路直接修成规范正道。她甚至甩出一句暴论：如果你还陷在“人肉 Code Review、一条条给 AI 留评论改代码”的泥潭里，这本身就是一种坏味道。 每次你忍不住手动纠偏，都该立刻反思：怎么把这条经验变成一道 Lint 或 CI 红灯？（顺带一提，这也是 Rust 最近在 AI 圈翻红的原因——编译器足够苛刻，不让写 unsafe，能编译过就大概率靠谱。）\n\n第二，别自己当 AI 的“肉身测试员”，但防它作弊还得玩“暗箱考试”。\n\n很多人用 Agent 提不上速，是因为自己成了最大瓶颈：AI 改完代码，人去本地点界面、截报错图、粘日志，AI 自信满满地第一百次大喊“我找到真凶了！”，结果还是猜错。\n\nLauren 的破局方式，是先给 Agent 装上能自己拉起应用、抓 CPU 火焰图和堆快照的验证技能（她还打包成插件叫 Pstack，自嘲 Potato Stack，顺手调侃同姓的 YC CEO Gary Tan 的 Gstack），最妙的是在里面附了一张 Feature Map（功能地图）——把所有功能路径、快捷键、DOM 选择器全画成图。从此就算同事在 Slack 群里甩一张没头没尾的截图、底下只配三个问号“？？？”，他们的云端 Agent（Benny）也能自己拉起云桌面复现，甚至直接回报：“问题复现了，但主分支上其实早修好了，直接发版就行。”\n\n更绝的是她维护这些 Skill 的方式——把 Eval（评测）当成 Agent 的单元测试，而且藏着一个极其暗黑的细节：拉起子 Agent 跑评测时，必须刻意把目录名伪装起来，绝不能让它察觉自己正在被考试。 因为现在的模型贼精，一旦发现自己在接受评测，就会刻意改变行为糊弄你。同时还得找不同模型当裁判防偏见，配 /loop 自动循环“爬山”，一路刷到 10/10。\n\n第三，烧 Token 建护栏看似肉疼，实则是把全公司都武装成“产线”。\n\n现场有人质疑：“你在 AI 实验室 Token 管够，普通团队哪烧得起？”Lauren 算了一笔极其清醒的账：如果不花前期 Token 把防呆护栏建扎实，难道去招一万个工程师、背上无穷无尽的排期和内耗吗？一旦护栏立住，哪怕换成更便宜、没那么大的模型，照样能稳稳写出好代码。\n\n更夸张的红利还在后面：配合他们刚发布的、界面长得像 iMessage 一样的 Agent 编排工具 Grockbot，加上 Dune 严丝合缝的 CI 护栏，现在他们公司的产品经理、设计师甚至市场同事（GTM）都在直接提 PR 修 Bug、发功能——Lauren 点开一看规范全过，直接盖章合并。\n\n这就好比你想让一支车队跑出极限圈速：普通人的打法是天天坐在副驾驶上扯着嗓子教车手怎么打方向盘、苦口婆心写十页驾驶守则；而真正狠的工程打法，是直接把赛道的防撞护栏焊成钢板、把所有能开偏的岔路口全封死，再给每辆车装上自动巡检雷达——车手爱抄近道？正好，唯一能抄的那条近道，就是你提前铺好的冠军路线。\n\n以前我们总以为，得等大模型再聪明十倍，才敢彻底撒手让 AI 自己干活；Lauren 用一个月 1,000 个 PR 证明了恰恰相反的真相：决定 AI 能不能替你通宵干活的，从来不是模型够不够聪明，而是你的代码库，够不够耐造。 https://t.co/XKwLAAzO92","username":"tyay2015","tweet_url":"https://x.com/tyay2015/status/2125565936031973582","first_link":"https://x.com/0xg4tsby/status/2125532998711886255/video/1","created_at":"November 25, 2026 at 09:23PM","liked_at":"2026-11-26T19:31:03.868720","source":"ifttt","private":false,"notfound":false,"react_tweet_data":{"__typename":"Tweet","favorite_count":1793,"lang":"zh","possibly_sensitive":false,"created_at":"2026-11-25T12:23:04.000Z","display_text_range":[0,150],"entities":{"media":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/XKwLAAzO92","expanded_url":"https://x.com/0xg4tsby/status/2125532998711886255/video/1","indices":[2404,2427],"url":"https://t.co/XKwLAAzO92"}]},"id_str":"2125565936031973582","text":"刚重听了一遍 Cursor 工程师 Lauren 这场近一小时的实战复盘，越琢磨越觉得反常识：\n\n同样是用 AI 写代码，大多数人还在天天给它擦屁股、被幻觉气到血压飙升，她却能上个月一个人狂合 1,000 个 PR，这个月刚到 12 号又干了近 800 个——甚至做分享那天早上她一觉醒来，Agent","user":{"id_str":"2028336570554863616","name":"Julian","screen_name":"tyay2015","is_blue_verified":true,"profile_image_shape":"Circle","verified":false,"profile_image_url_https":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2053315796982706176/B_UFs1A1_normal.jpg"},"edit_control":{"edit_tweet_ids":["2125565936031973582"],"editable_until_msecs":"1795612984000","edits_remaining":"5","is_edit_eligible":false},"mediaDetails":[{"additional_media_info":{},"display_url":"pic.x.com/XKwLAAzO92","expanded_url":"https://x.com/0xg4tsby/status/2125532998711886255/video/1","ext_media_availability":{"status":"Available"},"indices":[2404,2427],"media_url_https":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2125532357906030592/img/9qFenrg3QngfN-Fh.jpg","original_info":{"focus_rects":[],"height":1080,"width":1926},"sizes":{"large":{"h":1080,"resize":"fit","w":1926},"medium":{"h":673,"resize":"fit","w":1200},"small":{"h":381,"resize":"fit","w":680},"thumb":{"h":150,"resize":"crop","w":150}},"type":"video","url":"https://t.co/XKwLAAzO92","video_info":{"aspect_ratio":[107,60],"duration_millis":3525857,"variants":[{"content_type":"application/x-mpegURL","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2125532357906030592/pl/O0Xtqibhr9akOCra.m3u8?v=37c"},{"bitrate":256000,"content_type":"video/mp4","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2125532357906030592/vid/avc1/480x270/NdQBBAfXxSCiyMEl.mp4"},{"bitrate":832000,"content_t